    "lawCode": "",
    "lawSection": "Retirement",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S5743A\n\nSPONSOR: MARCELLINO\n \nTITLE OF BILL:  An act to grant Danielle Galasso a retroactive member-\nship date in the New York state and local employees' retirement system\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nThis legislation would grant Danielle Galasso a retroactive membership\ndate in the New York State and Local Employees' Retirement System.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nNotwithstanding any provision of law to the contrary, this legislation\nwould grant Danielle Galasso, an employee of the Town of Oyster Bay, a\nretroactive membership date in the NY State and Local Retirement System\nof July 10, 2003.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nDanielle Galasso, an employee with the Town of Oyster Bay and a member\nof the New York State and local retirement system, was employed by the\nTown of Oyster Bay in 2003 but failed to become a member of the retire-\nment system at that time.\n\nThe failure to join the system was not due to her own negligence and\nthis legislation addresses this issue by granting Ms. Galasso Tier IV\nstatus and deems her to have joined the system on July 10, 2003.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nSame as S.7680 of 2016\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nSee fiscal note.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
